m","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"旋转方向：顺时针、逆时针"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"旋转角度：45°、90°、120°、180°"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"翻转：左右翻转（上下不变）、上下翻转（左右不变）"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三、解题步骤"}]},{"type":"textDiagram","attrs":{"language":"mermaid"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"flowchart TD\n    A[元素组成相同?] -->|是| B{有格子/框架?}\n    B -->|是| C[考虑平移]\n    B -->|否| D{方向不同?}\n    D -->|是| E[考虑旋转/翻转]\n    D -->|否| F[考虑其他规律]\n    C --> G[确定方向和步数]\n    E --> H[确定方向和角度]\n    G --> I[代入验证]\n    H --> I"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"四、真题精讲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【例题】黑色 L 形和黑色方块在格子中，方块在内圈每次顺时针移动 1 格，L 形在外圈每次逆时针移动 1 格。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"元素组成相同，有格子 → 考虑平移"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"方块：内圈顺时针每次 1 格"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"L 形：外圈逆时针每次 1 格"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两个元素分别验证，同时满足的选项即为答案"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"五、易错点"}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#fef2f2","borderColor":"#ef4444","icon":"⚠️"},"content":[{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"多个元素时要分开看，不要混在一起观察"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"平移的循环和往返路径容易混淆"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"翻转和旋转容易搞混：翻转后左右/上下镜像对称，旋转后方向改变但不镜像"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内外圈分开看是宫格题的常用技巧"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#eff6ff","borderColor":"#3b82f6","icon":"📊"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷题建议：","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"动态位置是图形推理中占比约 20% 的最高频考点。平移是最常考的细分方向，旋转和翻转次之。建议每天做 10 道动态位置题，重点训练「多元素分开看」的习惯。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '图形推理位置类-动态位置的核心考点：平移、旋转、翻转的识别与解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["图形推理", "位置规律", "动态位置", "平移", "旋转", "翻转"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xc_tuTui_pos_dynamic", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
